  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CFYE Job and Business Booster Burkina Faso 2022 - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Job and Business Booster (JBB) works towards improved dignified self-employment (360 youth entrepreneurs), creating dignified wage-employment for other youth (1080).
Woord en Daad cooperates with local private partner ForthInvestment, with together substantial experience in youth employment, business development and inspired by youth.
We help potentially successful youth enterprises grow and use these same market-based enterprises to create employment for other youth. 

The project is co-funded by Challenge Fund for Youth Employment (CFYE). CFYE is a 6-year programme funded by the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs.</narrative>
  </description>
